---
// Hero Section with Female Creator Welcome & Trust Badges
---

<section
  class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-purple-50/70 via-white to-white pt-8 pb-14 sm:pt-14 sm:pb-20 border-b border-purple-100/60"
>
  <!-- Background glowing ambient spots -->
  <div
    class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full max-w-7xl h-96 pointer-events-none -z-10 opacity-60"
  >
    <div
      class="absolute -top-12 left-10 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-purple-200/50 blur-3xl"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute top-10 right-10 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-pink-200/40 blur-3xl"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute -bottom-8 left-1/3 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-purple-100/60 blur-3xl"
    >
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-8 items-center">
      <!-- Left Column: Copy & Presentation -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 text-center lg:text-left space-y-6">
        <!-- Creator Greeting Pill -->
        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white border border-purple-200 shadow-sm text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-purple-900 mx-auto lg:mx-0"
        >
          <span class="flex h-2.5 w-2.5 relative">
            <span
              class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-pink-400 opacity-75"
            ></span>
            <span
              class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-pink-500"
            ></span>
          </span>
          <span>Curadoria feminina independente & confiável</span>
          <span class="text-purple-400">✦</span>
          <span class="text-purple-600 font-bold">100% Testado</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Title -->
        <h1
          class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black font-display tracking-tight text-purple-950 leading-[1.12]"
        >
          Desejou? <span class="text-gradient-purple">Achou!</span><br
            class="hidden sm:inline"
          />
          Os melhores achadinhos da internet.
        </h1>

        <!-- Subtitle -->
        <p
          class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 font-normal leading-relaxed"
        >
          Oie! Aqui compartilho meus achados favoritos da <strong
            >Shopee, Amazon, Shein e Mercado Livre</strong
          >. Chega de perder tempo procurando ou cair em roubadas: tudo com
          cupom exclusivo, menor preço garantido e resenhas sinceras! 💜
        </p>

        <!-- CTA Buttons -->
        <div
          class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-3.5 pt-2"
        >
          <a
            href="#produtos"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full text-base font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-700 via-purple-600 to-pink-600 text-white shadow-lg shadow-purple-600/30 hover:shadow-purple-600/40 hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98] transition-all"
          >
            <span>Ver Achadinhos de Hoje</span>
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 fill-none stroke-current stroke-2"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M19.5 13.5L12 21m0 0l-7.5-7.5M12 21V3"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>

          <a
            href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/JfqhZBxAiS9AVHGI2LIvGq"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full text-base font-semibold bg-white text-purple-900 border border-purple-200 shadow-sm hover:bg-purple-50 hover:border-purple-300 transition-all"
          >
            <span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold text-lg">●</span>
            <span>Canal VIP no WhatsApp</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Trust Badges -->
        <div
          class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 pt-6 border-t border-purple-100 max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 text-left"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span
              class="text-lg sm:text-2xl font-black text-purple-950 font-display"
              >+500</span
            >
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium leading-tight"
              >Achados testados & postados</span
            >
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span
              class="text-lg sm:text-2xl font-black text-purple-950 font-display"
              >100%</span
            >
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium leading-tight"
              >Links oficiais e protegidos</span
            >
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span
              class="text-lg sm:text-2xl font-black text-purple-950 font-display"
              >Diário</span
            >
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium leading-tight"
              >Cupons secretos atualizados</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Visual Creator Card & Floating Elements -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-sm sm:max-w-md">
          <!-- Outer decorative glowing ring -->
          <div
            class="absolute -inset-2 bg-gradient-to-tr from-purple-500 via-pink-400 to-purple-300 rounded-3xl blur-xl opacity-40"
          >
          </div>

          <!-- Main Creator Card -->
          <div
            class="relative bg-white rounded-3xl p-5 shadow-2xl border border-purple-100 overflow-hidden"
          >
            <div
              class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-[4/4.2] mb-4 bg-purple-100"
            >
              <img
                src="ttps://6abbf38957212ca6e1ebbfa8.imgix.net/sandbox/larissa-gemini.jpeg?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80"
                alt="Criadora e Curadora do Desejou Achou"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
              />
              <div
                class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-purple-950/80 via-transparent to-transparent flex flex-col justify-end p-4 text-white"
              >
                <span
                  class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 self-start px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-600/90 backdrop-blur-md text-[11px] font-bold text-white mb-1"
                >
                  ✨ Curadora Oficial
                </span>
                <p class="text-lg font-bold font-display leading-tight">
                  "Garimpo a internet pra você só aproveitar os achadinhos de
                  verdade!"
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Floating Mini Card 1 (Top Right) -->
            <div
              class="absolute top-8 -right-4 sm:-right-6 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-purple-100 flex items-center gap-3 animate-pulse-subtle"
            >
              <div
                class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base shrink-0"
              >
                🏷️
              </div>
              <div class="text-left">
                <span
                  class="block text-[11px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold tracking-wider"
                  >Cupom Ativo</span
                >
                <span class="block text-xs font-black text-purple-950"
                  >DESEJOU15 • 15% OFF</span
                >
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Floating Mini Card 2 (Bottom Left) -->
            <div
              class="absolute bottom-16 -left-3 sm:-left-6 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md px-4 py-2.5 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-purple-100 flex items-center gap-3"
            >
              <div
                class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-pink-100 text-pink-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base shrink-0"
              >
                ⭐
              </div>
              <div class="text-left">
                <span class="block text-xs font-black text-purple-950"
                  >Nota 4.9 de 5.0</span
                >
                <span class="block text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium"
                  >+10 mil compras seguras</span
                >
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Footer of card -->
            <div
              class="flex items-center justify-between pt-2 px-1 text-xs text-slate-500"
            >
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-medium">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
                Novas ofertas adicionadas hoje
              </span>
              <a
                href="/sobre"
                class="font-bold text-purple-600 hover:text-purple-800 transition-colors"
              >
                Conhecer mais &rarr;
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
